1
00:00:25,183 --> 00:00:28,016
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,436 --> 00:00:31,043
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,356 --> 00:00:33,936
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,656 --> 00:00:37,529
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:38,129 --> 00:00:40,083
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,256 --> 00:00:43,056
♪Calm but full of pearl♪

7
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:45,963
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,383 --> 00:00:49,209
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:52,990 --> 00:00:53,593
=Quite The Girl=

10
00:00:53,617 --> 00:00:54,152
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

11
00:00:54,176 --> 00:00:54,639
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

12
00:00:54,663 --> 00:00:55,867
=Episode 13=

13
00:01:05,079 --> 00:01:06,000
It's you?

14
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:10,439
Yeah.

15
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,400
It's me.

16
00:01:14,384 --> 00:01:16,384
♪The day we met the breeze felt sweet♪

17
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,319
You little liar.

18
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,959
I missed ten years of your life.

19
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,040
I'm sorry.

20
00:01:24,815 --> 00:01:31,738
♪My heart skipped a beat
I lost my words♪

21
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:37,436
♪So this is what love feels like♪

22
00:01:39,610 --> 00:01:46,015
♪You took my hand, said don't be scared♪

23
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:46,879
Lu Mingye.

24
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:50,400
The one I've been looking for all along

25
00:01:51,959 --> 00:01:52,760
is you.

26
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:58,280
Was everything just now a lie?

27
00:01:58,280 --> 00:02:01,280
♪Now I know what longing is♪

28
00:02:01,641 --> 00:02:08,072
♪From dawn to starlight with you♪

29
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,520
Ten years ago, you lied to me.

30
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:12,479
Ten years later, I lied to you once.

31
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,639
Now we're even.

32
00:02:16,450 --> 00:02:21,769
♪I want to grow old with you♪

33
00:02:24,189 --> 00:02:30,919
♪Sharing one umbrella in the rain♪

34
00:02:33,039 --> 00:02:35,280
You've always been a wild one.

35
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,159
No more being the good girl.

36
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:38,639
Don't let anyone push you around.

37
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:41,159
Now you're a force to be reckoned with.

38
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:42,639
Lu Mingyu,

39
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,439
let me stay with you

40
00:02:46,439 --> 00:02:47,479
and bring Lu Mingye back.

41
00:02:48,084 --> 00:02:52,167
♪Even the ordinary can shine so bright♪

42
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,719
After my parents died,

43
00:02:55,879 --> 00:02:58,000
no one has called me Lu Mingye.

44
00:03:00,815 --> 00:03:07,739
♪Every day is a gentle embrace♪

45
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,680
Accept your fate, Lu Mingye.

46
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,319
Whether it's Xiangjiang

47
00:03:15,159 --> 00:03:16,360
or that wedding,

48
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:18,879
you can't escape.

49
00:03:22,886 --> 00:03:29,824
♪Now I know what longing is♪

50
00:03:30,460 --> 00:03:36,946
♪From dawn to starlight with you♪

51
00:03:37,344 --> 00:03:43,691
♪You're all my joy, my every heartbeat♪

52
00:03:45,026 --> 00:03:50,513
♪I want to grow old with you♪

53
00:03:52,552 --> 00:03:59,504
♪Sharing one umbrella in the rain♪

54
00:03:59,707 --> 00:04:05,554
♪Every tomorrow, I want you to know♪

55
00:04:06,904 --> 00:04:13,223
♪You're all my joy, all my pride♪

56
00:04:14,735 --> 00:04:20,304
♪Even the ordinary can shine so bright♪

57
00:04:22,578 --> 00:04:29,002
♪With you by my side♪

58
00:04:29,463 --> 00:04:36,164
♪Every day is a gentle embrace♪

59
00:04:36,648 --> 00:04:43,523
♪You're all my joy, and I'll be fine♪

60
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,920
It's so late.

61
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,680
Why are you still up?

62
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:30,040
Go ahead and sleep.

63
00:05:31,079 --> 00:05:34,800
I have an urgent international meeting.

64
00:05:50,839 --> 00:05:52,800
(Xu Suyue: How are things
with Duan Xiuming?)

65
00:05:53,199 --> 00:05:55,399
(Are you two inseparable now?)

66
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,279
(No.)

67
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,160
Mr. Duan,

68
00:06:12,759 --> 00:06:13,279
don't worry.

69
00:06:13,839 --> 00:06:15,759
Miss Lu is recovering very well.

70
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,759
All her nutritional indicators are up.

71
00:06:17,759 --> 00:06:18,800
Even better than expected.

72
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,720
The aftereffects we were worried about

73
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:22,279
haven't shown up so far.

74
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:23,399
That's good.

75
00:06:23,639 --> 00:06:24,319
Thank you.

76
00:06:32,439 --> 00:06:35,279
About what I asked... does she...

77
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:39,040
need to abstain

78
00:06:39,519 --> 00:06:40,680
at this stage?

79
00:06:42,639 --> 00:06:43,199
Mr. Duan,

80
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:44,839
no problem at all.

81
00:06:45,199 --> 00:06:46,600
Her bodily functions

82
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:47,959
are back to normal.

83
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:50,040
As long as you don't overdo it.

84
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:51,720
Thank you.

85
00:06:52,079 --> 00:06:52,519
But...

86
00:06:52,839 --> 00:06:54,120
you still need to be careful!

87
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:03,319
You've got three seconds
to call the police on me.

88
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:04,399
Call the police?

89
00:07:05,439 --> 00:07:06,040
What's wrong?

90
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:08,519
Three, two, one.

91
00:07:25,708 --> 00:07:30,083
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

92
00:07:32,841 --> 00:07:36,660
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

93
00:07:39,946 --> 00:07:44,439
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

94
00:07:45,556 --> 00:07:50,174
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

95
00:07:53,100 --> 00:07:59,336
♪A love letter written in song♪

96
00:07:59,930 --> 00:08:04,693
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

97
00:08:07,167 --> 00:08:12,855
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

98
00:08:13,856 --> 00:08:19,718
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

99
00:08:20,376 --> 00:08:27,345
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

100
00:08:27,835 --> 00:08:34,258
♪I'll read every look on your face♪

101
00:08:34,504 --> 00:08:41,361
♪Gemini's joy, a little magic for you♪

102
00:08:42,003 --> 00:08:47,232
♪Close your eyes and count♪

103
00:08:47,307 --> 00:08:48,883
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

104
00:08:48,929 --> 00:08:55,596
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

105
00:08:56,143 --> 00:09:02,344
♪I'll read every look on your face♪

106
00:09:02,735 --> 00:09:09,728
♪Gemini's joy, a magic trick for you♪

107
00:09:11,240 --> 00:09:12,120
Duan Xiuming.

108
00:09:12,679 --> 00:09:14,080
Your hands are beautiful.

109
00:09:15,559 --> 00:09:19,774
♪It's my gift to you♪

110
00:09:20,374 --> 00:09:27,360
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

111
00:09:27,946 --> 00:09:34,421
♪I'll read every look on your face♪

112
00:09:34,446 --> 00:09:41,397
♪Gemini's joy, a magic trick for you♪

113
00:09:42,241 --> 00:09:47,304
♪Close your eyes and count♪

114
00:09:47,328 --> 00:09:54,008
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

115
00:10:12,799 --> 00:10:13,360
Mingye.

116
00:10:23,679 --> 00:10:25,360
I told you to wait for me
at the apartment.

117
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,360
What are you doing here?

118
00:10:27,039 --> 00:10:28,679
You weren't coming back,
and I got worried.

119
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,200
So I came to pick you up.

120
00:10:31,399 --> 00:10:33,039
What were you hiding, all sneaky?

121
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:34,759
Nothing.

122
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:38,320
I was doing homework.

123
00:10:38,799 --> 00:10:40,080
New homework from the teacher.

124
00:10:40,639 --> 00:10:41,240
Let's go home.

125
00:10:41,399 --> 00:10:42,039
Do it next time.

126
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,080
(Uncle: Mingyu,)

127
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:02,840
(want to see your grandma?)

128
00:11:30,373 --> 00:11:33,186
(Voice message from Uncle)

129
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:35,240
(Yes, your grandma is still alive.)

130
00:11:35,759 --> 00:11:37,080
(But how long she lives depends)

131
00:11:37,559 --> 00:11:39,320
(on when you come home.)

132
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,360
What do you want?

133
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:58,799
Mingyu,

134
00:11:59,559 --> 00:12:01,480
you've been enjoying yourself
out there lately, huh?

135
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:03,759
You even forgot to call your family.

136
00:12:38,223 --> 00:12:42,816
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

137
00:12:45,403 --> 00:12:49,356
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

138
