♪Gemini's joy♪

145
00:13:37,168 --> 00:13:39,897
♪Lets art fill our love♪

146
00:13:40,657 --> 00:13:42,816
♪Close your eyes and count♪

147
00:13:43,107 --> 00:13:45,721
♪The starry sky♪

148
